# CR 305: playing a Island the same shape land-played-then-tapped-for-mana
# already proves for Plains -- one per turn, immediately usable for its own
# intrinsic mana ability the same turn (CR 302.6 does not restrict a land's
# own mana ability, only a creature's tap ability).
startturn human
advance 3
playland human 1
tapformana human 1 U
paymanacost human U
